      "content": "Hey, I need help putting together a quick 5-day itinerary for one of our VPs. He's heading to Southeast Asia next month for some meetings. We need to cover Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City. Can you sketch out a logical flow that minimizes travel fatigue and keeps him in business-class hotels? He needs enough time for formal dinners each night.",
